You can be that bigger person

00:13:41.187 --> 00:13:45.058
and you can create that next
chapter of that relationship,

00:13:45.058 --> 00:13:46.626
even if it's not the
relationship.

00:13:46.626 --> 00:13:48.561
Even if it's your great
aunt, and you don't need

00:13:48.561 --> 00:13:51.698
it to be the greatest
relationship of all time.

00:13:51.698 --> 00:13:53.766
Just remember, 
these people are not going

00:13:53.766 --> 00:13:57.036
to be around one day and, 
I don't know,

00:13:57.036 --> 00:14:00.473
it just feels like 
the right thing to do.

